  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.07 Permittee identification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.07 “Permittee identification” means all of the following information for the permittee:\n\n(a) If an individual, the permittee’s name, permit number, mailing address, daytime telephone number, and email address; or\n\n(b) If other than an individual, the name and mailing address of the corporation, partnership, or association, and the authorized contact information.\n\nSource. #14103, eff 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw100.html"
